Z||000005||BOILERMAKER||07-03-2001||04:45 PM||||OK, uhhhhhhh $200.  I just said that to see if BENAGAL was watching.<P>anyway, I honestly wouldn't pay anything for it because I don't need another one, but definitely $3000 is too high in my opinion.  But, all the items can be fixed easily with the exception of the ticking (I'll drill if Drew drops the cradle).   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>||||reg||1
